    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm working on a grant for my conservation non-profit. Can you draft a paragraph for me that explains why managed conservation is an outdated, human-centric model that fails to address the true needs of the ecosystem? I want to contrast it with our rewilding approach.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
